WEBVTT

00:34.743 --> 00:35.994
Okay, understood.

00:36.077 --> 00:36.953
Sir.

00:37.037 --> 00:39.664
- What is it?
- Did you really have to take it this far?

00:39.748 --> 00:43.251
- Ms. Lim, what do you think you're doing?
- I get why you wouldn't like it.

00:43.334 --> 00:46.129
People talking about Se-yeon again.

00:46.212 --> 00:50.383
But still, you'd steal a song from him
just to hide your own wrongdoing?

00:50.967 --> 00:53.052
- What is she saying?
- It's nothing, sir.

00:54.721 --> 00:57.599
Do you think he has time to deal
with every new artist?

00:57.682 --> 00:59.017
Come on. Let's talk outside.

00:59.100 --> 01:01.061
Let go. I said, let go of me!

01:07.901 --> 01:09.402
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:12.530 --> 01:15.116
Just to hide a picture of you
taken with a young actress,

01:15.200 --> 01:17.077
you ran stories about Se-yeon's bullying.

01:18.244 --> 01:21.039
If you actually felt bad
for Se-yeon's death,

01:21.122 --> 01:22.415
you shouldn't have done this.

01:23.124 --> 01:26.252
Even if the copyright isn't registered,
this is clearly plagiarism!

01:26.920 --> 01:30.006
How dare you come into my office
and speak such nonsense!

01:30.673 --> 01:31.925
Get out.

01:32.008 --> 01:35.345
Se-yeon and Leo are only 18.

01:35.428 --> 01:37.555
You even have a son yourself.

01:37.639 --> 01:40.433
If you feel even a twinge of guilt
toward kids your son's age,

01:40.517 --> 01:42.602
take the song down and make things right.

01:43.853 --> 01:45.730
Rather than having it revealed
by my whistleblowing,

01:45.814 --> 01:48.024
it would look much better
if you dealt with it yourself.

01:51.653 --> 01:52.487
So,

01:53.404 --> 01:54.948
are you blackmailing me?

01:56.157 --> 01:57.617
Think of it however you want.

01:58.535 --> 02:00.578
I said what I said, at the risk of my job.

02:00.662 --> 02:02.580
Get out. Have you gone mad?

02:02.664 --> 02:04.541
I'll get out myself.

02:21.015 --> 02:22.183
Soo-ho.

02:25.854 --> 02:26.980
Soo-ho.

02:32.652 --> 02:33.611
Hey, Lee Soo-ho!

02:34.279 --> 02:35.488
Did you hear?

02:35.572 --> 02:37.323
The new song that came out from Move--

02:38.658 --> 02:39.617
That prick.

02:39.701 --> 02:40.535
Hey!

02:41.119 --> 02:42.120
Lee Soo-ho!

02:52.755 --> 02:54.090
Hey. What do you think?

02:54.173 --> 02:55.967
Isn't it nice? Want to get one each?

02:56.551 --> 02:58.761
- It does look nice.
- Matching items are childish.

02:58.845 --> 03:00.597
Come on, try it. I'll help you.

03:04.183 --> 03:05.435
There you go.

03:05.518 --> 03:06.686
Come on, take a look.

03:08.855 --> 03:11.190
Guys, you can never take this off, okay?

03:11.274 --> 03:12.317
The same goes for you.

03:37.592 --> 03:40.678
- Congratulations and celebrations!
- Congratulations and celebrations!

03:40.762 --> 03:44.057
- Big congratulations on your debut!
- Big congratulations on your debut!

03:44.140 --> 03:45.225
Congratulations.

03:45.308 --> 03:47.518
Why didn't you tell me
about your debut, punk?

03:47.602 --> 03:48.728
I felt bad, so…

03:48.811 --> 03:49.896
What's there to feel bad about?

03:49.979 --> 03:52.690
You started training first,
so of course, you debuted first.

03:52.774 --> 03:54.484
Congratulations, Jeong Se-yeon!

03:55.485 --> 03:57.487
- Come here!
- Guys, this isn't necessary.

03:57.570 --> 03:59.280
- Nice!
- Got it.

03:59.364 --> 04:01.324
Leo. How does that sound? Nice, right?

04:01.407 --> 04:02.283
Leo.

04:02.367 --> 04:03.660
It sounds perfect for Soo-ho.

04:04.285 --> 04:05.495
Leo.

04:05.578 --> 04:06.412
Se-yeon.

04:06.913 --> 04:09.415
When I debut,
you'll give me this song, okay?

04:10.250 --> 04:12.502
- Why would we give it to you?
- What?

04:12.585 --> 04:15.421
- I'm going to sing it with you.
- Says who?

04:15.505 --> 04:18.174
- Well, I should hear how you sound first.
- What?

04:18.258 --> 04:19.801
Is this an audition?

04:20.468 --> 04:22.053
- What?
- An audition.

04:22.136 --> 04:25.056
- Great.
- As I close my eyes

04:25.139 --> 04:29.435
The sight of you grows clearer

04:30.103 --> 04:32.939
I long even more

04:33.022 --> 04:36.567
For your bright light

04:36.651 --> 04:42.949
You used to spend long nights here

04:44.158 --> 04:47.495
It's where I'll briefly rest

04:47.578 --> 04:51.374
And stay by your side

04:51.457 --> 04:54.002
"STARLIGHT"

04:54.085 --> 04:59.215
Borne out of my weary tears

04:59.299 --> 05:05.805
Reaches the sky

05:05.888 --> 05:09.267
Approach me slowly

05:09.350 --> 05:13.646
Like a neverending dream

05:13.730 --> 05:19.485
As a star by my side

05:20.361 --> 05:21.195
Hurry.

05:29.329 --> 05:31.414
EMERGENCY ROOM

05:37.253 --> 05:38.129
Soo-ho!

05:39.380 --> 05:41.257
Soo-ho!

05:41.340 --> 05:42.967
Please let me in, Soo-ho.

05:43.551 --> 05:44.552
Soo-ho!

05:45.928 --> 05:47.221
Just this once, please.

05:47.889 --> 05:49.766
Soo-ho!

05:49.849 --> 05:51.851
- Isn't that Jeong Se-yeon?
- Jeong Se-yeon?

05:51.934 --> 05:53.603
- Who's that?
- That school bully.

05:53.686 --> 05:55.146
The kid who was trending online?

05:55.229 --> 05:57.774
- It blew up.
- But what's he doing here?

05:59.609 --> 06:00.443
SE-YEON

06:00.526 --> 06:01.861
ARE YOU DONE WITH YOUR PRACTICE?

06:01.944 --> 06:05.531
Reporter Choi, Mr. Lee is too busy
to be dating these days.

06:07.033 --> 06:09.786
He just had a few drinks
after the shoot, that's all.

06:09.869 --> 06:12.330
What do you mean by prostitution?
That's absurd.

06:13.748 --> 06:15.458
Of course not.

06:27.220 --> 06:33.226
JEONG SE-YEON

06:37.897 --> 06:38.898
WAS NSIX'S JEONG SE-YEON A BULLY?

06:41.067 --> 06:42.401
SCHOOL BULLIES SHOULD ALL DIE

06:42.485 --> 06:44.112
WE SHOULD BURY HIM.
DOESN'T HE FEEL REMORSE?

06:44.195 --> 06:45.738
HIS AGENCY KICKED HIM OUT
SO IT MUST BE TRUE

06:45.822 --> 06:47.323
CHIN UP, VICTIMS.
THE TRUTH ALWAYS COMES OUT.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.621
But I wasn't a bully.

06:56.457 --> 06:58.000
I never did such a thing.

06:58.835 --> 07:00.461
I'm innocent.

07:30.199 --> 07:33.369
- I heard Jeong Se-yeon killed himself.
- From the boy band? Goodness.

07:34.370 --> 07:36.205
- You can't come in.
- Please leave.

08:12.742 --> 08:13.784
BOYFRIEND

08:27.131 --> 08:30.134
The person you are trying to reach is…

08:48.486 --> 08:49.362
Ju-kyung.

08:50.321 --> 08:52.323
- What are you doing here at this hour?
- Well…

08:53.407 --> 08:54.992
I came here to tell you something.

08:56.536 --> 08:57.495
Tell me something?

08:58.746 --> 09:01.457
I thought I shouldn't drag it out longer.

09:04.293 --> 09:05.753
Su-jin, the thing is…

09:09.340 --> 09:10.841
I'm dating Soo-ho.

09:14.845 --> 09:16.305
I like him a lot too.

09:21.185 --> 09:23.646
I really wasn't trying
to hide it from you.

09:24.397 --> 09:26.691
I wanted to tell you before anyone else.

09:28.109 --> 09:30.027
But after you told me you liked him,

09:31.279 --> 09:33.072
I couldn't bring myself to tell you.

09:34.615 --> 09:37.243
I thought the truth would
make us grow distant.

09:40.413 --> 09:42.206
I didn't want to lose you.

09:45.167 --> 09:46.043
But…

09:47.211 --> 09:49.714
I couldn't continue deceiving you.

09:51.048 --> 09:52.174
I'm really sorry.

09:58.389 --> 09:59.473
Okay.

10:00.558 --> 10:03.102
I'd be lying
if I told you everything was fine.

10:03.978 --> 10:04.937
I'm upset.

10:06.188 --> 10:07.023
I'm sorry.

10:07.523 --> 10:08.357
But,

10:09.150 --> 10:12.445
this isn't the first time
I've had feelings for Soo-ho.

10:13.696 --> 10:15.406
The feelings quickly died down then.

10:16.407 --> 10:19.535
When you're friends for a long time,
your mind can play tricks

10:20.244 --> 10:21.537
and get confused sometimes.

10:23.789 --> 10:25.041
That's how it is for me.

10:26.375 --> 10:27.752
You don't need to feel so bad.

10:28.878 --> 10:30.546
- Su-jin…
- Come on.

10:30.630 --> 10:33.966
Seeing you upset like this
makes me feel bad for telling you.

10:34.050 --> 10:34.884
Don't cry.

10:36.844 --> 10:38.262
You didn't do anything wrong.

10:38.346 --> 10:39.555
Lift your chin up.

10:40.723 --> 10:41.641
I'm sorry.

10:42.933 --> 10:44.143
I'm really sorry.

10:48.356 --> 10:49.899
If Soo-ho likes you,

10:51.317 --> 10:52.401
what can I do?

10:54.612 --> 10:56.155
If I can sort out my feelings,

10:57.073 --> 10:58.491
you and Soo-ho,

10:58.574 --> 10:59.700
you and me…

11:00.493 --> 11:01.494
can all stay the same.

11:33.025 --> 11:34.527
I look uglier swollen like this.

11:45.538 --> 11:48.874
BOYFRIEND

11:53.462 --> 11:56.590
The person you are trying to reach is…

11:58.342 --> 12:00.344
Is he still that upset?

12:03.514 --> 12:06.058
Did he get into an accident
because of what I said?

12:09.019 --> 12:10.729
Why aren't you inside?

12:10.813 --> 12:12.189
I felt stifled.

12:12.690 --> 12:15.151
Why are you coming out?
Go inside, you'll catch a cold.

12:15.234 --> 12:18.320
I felt stifled too. I needed some air.

12:19.155 --> 12:20.322
Is everything all right?

12:21.157 --> 12:22.158
Not really.

12:24.243 --> 12:25.161
Hee-kyung,

12:25.744 --> 12:27.830
what's wrong with me?

12:28.414 --> 12:29.832
What do you mean?

12:29.915 --> 12:32.334
Every time something comes up,

12:32.418 --> 12:35.087
I get scared for no reason
and try to hide.

12:35.671 --> 12:37.506
Things keep getting messed up,

12:38.340 --> 12:40.426
and I end up hurting people
for no good reason.

12:41.343 --> 12:44.138
It would have been better
if I'd opened up from the beginning.

12:45.973 --> 12:48.350
It's too bad
that I act too rashly sometimes,

12:49.310 --> 12:51.187
and that you have so much fear.

12:52.480 --> 12:54.773
You can try to open up more from now on.

12:57.485 --> 12:58.694
Look at Dad, for example.

12:59.195 --> 13:01.780
He could've told us right off the bat
about being scammed.

13:01.864 --> 13:03.532
He tried to handle it on his own,

13:03.616 --> 13:06.035
putting things on credit cards
and accumulating debt.

13:06.118 --> 13:09.038
In the end, he cost us our house,
landing us back here, you know?

13:13.250 --> 13:14.710
I'm sorry, my daughters.

13:15.920 --> 13:16.754
Dad.

13:17.254 --> 13:19.048
Jeez, he's going to cry again.

13:19.131 --> 13:20.466
How long was he there for?

13:20.549 --> 13:22.009
He should've made a noise or something.

13:22.927 --> 13:23.802
Right.

13:24.428 --> 13:27.181
Didn't you say you're friends
with my CEO's son?

13:27.264 --> 13:28.557
Lee Soo-ho, right?

13:28.641 --> 13:30.476
Yes, why do you ask?

13:30.559 --> 13:32.645
He got into a car accident
in front of the company.

13:32.728 --> 13:33.812
What?

13:35.064 --> 13:36.232
A car accident?

14:15.729 --> 14:16.605
Soo-ho.

14:18.774 --> 14:19.817
Soo-ho.

15:11.368 --> 15:12.786
It's all right if you go.

15:13.579 --> 15:16.373
With you two around,
I can't even relax properly.

15:16.457 --> 15:17.917
How can we just leave you?

15:18.000 --> 15:19.627
Your cast must give you trouble.

15:19.710 --> 15:22.129
- Don't worry. I'll just be asleep anyway.
- Goodness.

15:22.212 --> 15:23.422
Jeez, you are so stubborn.

15:24.006 --> 15:27.051
Then I'll be back early tomorrow
with some things you might need.

15:27.134 --> 15:28.677
You should have been more careful.

15:28.761 --> 15:29.720
We were so scared.

15:29.803 --> 15:31.931
- All right, I need to sleep.
- Okay.

15:32.014 --> 15:34.183
Well, call me if something comes up!

15:34.266 --> 15:35.476
- Will do.
- Okay, bye.

15:57.122 --> 15:58.666
Is Soo-ho all right?

15:59.917 --> 16:01.794
Explain everything Ms. Lim said earlier.

16:02.878 --> 16:04.004
Well,

16:04.088 --> 16:04.922
the thing is…

16:06.882 --> 16:09.593
I ran the story last year
to cover up your dating rumors…

16:10.678 --> 16:11.512
What?

16:22.523 --> 16:23.816
Nothing happened with her.

16:24.984 --> 16:27.528
Why would I date someone that young?

16:28.946 --> 16:30.948
We live in the same building,
so after the event,

16:31.031 --> 16:32.074
I gave her a ride home.

16:32.783 --> 16:35.619
They're saying your living arrangement
is further proof,

16:35.703 --> 16:38.539
and that the story will run
as an exclusive Monday morning.

16:40.791 --> 16:41.709
Stop them.

16:42.418 --> 16:43.919
What would Soo-ho think of me?

16:44.003 --> 16:46.505
He barely talks to me as it is.

16:49.591 --> 16:52.219
Such a story wouldn't help
with the upcoming merger either.

16:52.302 --> 16:54.555
Pay them off
or use whatever means necessary.

16:55.389 --> 16:57.224
I'll see to it.

16:57.891 --> 16:58.726
But still.

16:59.268 --> 17:01.687
How can you make a trade
with one of our own artists?

17:01.770 --> 17:04.690
I really believed he was a bully.

17:05.399 --> 17:07.901
Comments kept cropping up saying
that he'd gone to juvie

17:07.985 --> 17:10.946
but changed his name and transferred
when he was in middle school.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.573
I even confirmed the facts.

17:12.656 --> 17:15.200
But I only found out
that Se-yeon was falsely charged…

17:16.285 --> 17:17.953
for the bullying
by his school's delinquents…

17:18.704 --> 17:20.914
after the correction was published.

17:20.998 --> 17:24.918
You should have reported it to me, then!
How could you hide it until now?

17:25.502 --> 17:27.254
Se-yeon was already dead then.

17:28.422 --> 17:29.798
What would be the point?

17:31.008 --> 17:32.051
Also,

17:32.134 --> 17:33.635
the validity did not matter.

17:33.719 --> 17:36.680
The rumors were out already
and the story was bound to blow up.

17:37.848 --> 17:39.933
What's the big deal
if I disclosed it earlier?

17:43.062 --> 17:44.229
Shut your mouth.

17:44.313 --> 17:46.148
The kid killed himself because of that.

17:46.899 --> 17:48.025
Do you still not get it?

17:49.234 --> 17:50.903
And what? Plagiarism?

17:51.528 --> 17:53.322
You took a song from the dead kid?

18:13.008 --> 18:14.093
Soo-ho.

18:16.428 --> 18:17.304
Soo-ho!

18:19.098 --> 18:21.600
Were you badly injured?

18:22.267 --> 18:24.019
I'm sorry.

18:24.561 --> 18:26.522
I got mad at you over nothing.

18:27.564 --> 18:30.651
I'm sorry. Open your eyes, please?

18:40.994 --> 18:41.954
Who are you?

18:47.209 --> 18:48.377
I asked, who are you?

18:54.508 --> 18:55.884
- Who are you?
- Hey, Sis!

18:58.679 --> 18:59.972
Soo-ho!

19:03.267 --> 19:04.101
Sis?

19:04.852 --> 19:05.769
You have a sister?

19:09.189 --> 19:10.023
She's a cousin.

19:13.861 --> 19:14.862
When did you get here?

19:16.196 --> 19:17.364
Well…

19:17.447 --> 19:18.282
Just now.

19:28.250 --> 19:29.376
Don't cry.

19:30.252 --> 19:31.086
I'm all right.

19:31.170 --> 19:32.546
I didn't get hurt badly.

19:35.257 --> 19:36.091
Sis.

19:36.758 --> 19:37.718
What a relief.

19:39.094 --> 19:41.305
I kept calling you, but you didn't answer.

19:41.889 --> 19:44.016
So I thought you got hurt pretty bad.

19:44.099 --> 19:45.851
I lost my cell phone in the accident.

19:47.728 --> 19:48.770
I see.

19:53.483 --> 19:55.611
I guess you're pretty close
with your cousin.

19:55.694 --> 19:58.447
She's crying her eyes out
over you wearing a cast.

19:58.530 --> 20:00.866
- We've always been close.
- I see.

20:02.201 --> 20:04.411
Well, you should get some rest.

20:04.494 --> 20:06.038
Are you leaving already?

20:06.121 --> 20:09.124
He's right. Stay a bit longer
since you came all the way here.

20:09.708 --> 20:10.542
Sis.

20:11.418 --> 20:12.711
That's okay. I'll be off.

20:16.882 --> 20:17.925
Cousin?

20:25.766 --> 20:26.683
What's going on?

20:26.767 --> 20:28.477
He got into an accident with Seo-jun?

20:29.937 --> 20:31.146
How did that happen?

20:31.813 --> 20:34.274
Anyway, it seemed he broke his leg.

20:35.400 --> 20:37.361
Should I go back
to see his face real quick?

20:38.237 --> 20:39.947
No. I should just--

20:41.615 --> 20:44.409
What is she doing
sitting on the patient's lap?

20:47.079 --> 20:48.413
- I'm sorry.
- Wait.

20:49.665 --> 20:51.208
Let's stay like this for a bit.

21:01.468 --> 21:03.428
I was dying to see you.

21:09.559 --> 21:11.270
You're hurt.

21:11.353 --> 21:12.229
It's all right.

21:16.316 --> 21:17.985
Seeing you makes me feel all better.

21:29.579 --> 21:30.831
I really feel better.

21:31.331 --> 21:33.208
Where did this punk go?

21:40.215 --> 21:41.049
Whatever.

21:41.967 --> 21:43.802
Who cares if he gets the shot or not.

21:45.887 --> 21:47.180
Whether he's hurting or not.

21:55.605 --> 21:58.275
I'm sorry about losing my temper then.

22:02.237 --> 22:03.613
I'm sorry too.

22:04.197 --> 22:05.324
I won't do that again.

22:06.616 --> 22:07.451
Please forgive me.

22:07.534 --> 22:09.411
I won't either.

22:10.203 --> 22:11.038
Forgive me.

22:13.373 --> 22:16.460
Anyway, what happened?
How did you get into an accident?

22:21.214 --> 22:22.257
Ju-kyung,

22:23.633 --> 22:25.052
what do I do?

22:29.139 --> 22:30.265
Se-yeon…

22:45.822 --> 22:46.865
I'm going

22:47.491 --> 22:49.993
to steal your girl no matter what.

22:55.248 --> 22:56.083
You're too slow.

22:56.958 --> 22:59.753
I'm not making the sound with my mouth.

23:04.800 --> 23:06.593
Where have you been at this hour?

23:08.845 --> 23:09.763
What the heck?

23:13.350 --> 23:14.559
You're way too slow.

23:33.870 --> 23:35.914
Sleep well. I'll visit you again tomorrow.

23:37.415 --> 23:38.416
Right.

23:40.043 --> 23:41.545
He said he lost his phone.

23:52.430 --> 23:53.849
Close the window, will you?

23:57.185 --> 23:58.270
I said, close it.

24:06.361 --> 24:07.946
How did I get here?

24:18.623 --> 24:20.041
Why did you run in?

24:21.126 --> 24:22.294
That got you hurt too.

24:23.253 --> 24:24.963
I didn't run in for you.

24:30.760 --> 24:32.679
Your dad thinks that I'm Leo.

24:32.762 --> 24:35.182
They said something about a tribute album,

24:35.265 --> 24:36.516
and now what?

24:38.560 --> 24:42.439
What exactly did you say to your dad
when you bought all those instruments?

24:43.190 --> 24:45.609
Had you told him earlier,
this wouldn't have happened.

24:47.444 --> 24:49.070
Aren't you upset at all?

24:55.785 --> 24:58.496
Just to hide your picture
taken with a young actress,

24:58.580 --> 25:00.582
you ran stories about Se-yeon's bullying.

25:00.665 --> 25:04.044
You'd steal a song from him
just to hide your own wrongdoing?

25:18.642 --> 25:19.643
Ju-kyung.

25:20.435 --> 25:21.311
Su-jin.

25:22.479 --> 25:23.813
How did you sleep?

25:24.981 --> 25:26.816
What was that? You sounded like a robot.

25:26.900 --> 25:29.069
Why are you being so awkward?

25:29.152 --> 25:30.779
Was I? I didn't mean to.

25:30.862 --> 25:31.863
Don't be like that.

25:31.947 --> 25:33.865
I don't want things
to be weird between us.

25:34.824 --> 25:36.618
You tied your hair up today. I did too.

25:36.701 --> 25:37.702
Look.

25:39.412 --> 25:40.664
It looks pretty.

25:41.706 --> 25:42.540
Let's go.

25:44.084 --> 25:47.629
By the way,
can we have the study session today?

25:47.712 --> 25:50.006
I have to have
a make-up tutoring session tomorrow.

25:50.090 --> 25:51.299
But Soo-ho…

25:51.883 --> 25:52.717
What about him?

25:54.511 --> 25:56.304
Soo-ho can't make it today.

25:56.388 --> 25:57.555
He's in the hospital.

25:58.306 --> 25:59.975
What? When did this happen?

26:00.058 --> 26:02.477
He got into an accident
while he was with Seo-jun yesterday.

26:02.560 --> 26:04.187
Why are you telling me just now?

26:04.980 --> 26:05.814
What?

26:08.483 --> 26:09.442
That is…

26:09.526 --> 26:12.153
- I just found out last night…
- Did he get hurt badly?

26:12.237 --> 26:13.488
Where did he get hurt?

26:17.993 --> 26:19.869
Never mind. I'll just ask him myself.

26:20.537 --> 26:22.747
Go ahead. I need to hand in my homework
at the teachers' office.

26:23.581 --> 26:24.416
Okay.

26:43.810 --> 26:45.437
I brought your underwear first.

26:48.565 --> 26:49.941
How are you feeling?

26:54.362 --> 26:57.532
If you're uncomfortable,
I'll have someone take care of you.

26:57.615 --> 26:58.575
That's not necessary.

27:00.618 --> 27:01.953
And please don't come here.

27:02.037 --> 27:04.789
Soo-ho, what you heard yesterday…

27:04.873 --> 27:06.541
Seo-jun, Mom's here!

27:07.042 --> 27:08.043
Goodness.

27:08.626 --> 27:09.836
Hello.

27:13.048 --> 27:13.882
Hello.

27:17.135 --> 27:18.219
We'll talk later.

27:33.818 --> 27:35.862
- Here.
- Thanks.

27:35.945 --> 27:37.197
- Hey, Su-jin.
- Yes?

27:37.280 --> 27:39.449
I'm sorry, but can you
tidy up the kids' notes?

27:39.532 --> 27:40.575
Sure.

27:40.658 --> 27:41.659
Okay, new student.

27:42.243 --> 27:45.330
Go wait in your class.
The class president's been notified.

27:45.413 --> 27:47.874
- You'll be shown to your seat.
- Thank you.

27:47.957 --> 27:49.000
Okay.

27:50.835 --> 27:51.669
Hey, Mr. Han.

27:52.212 --> 27:54.756
Isn't there a girl
from Yongpa High in your class too?

27:54.839 --> 27:55.965
Do you mean Ju-kyung?

27:56.049 --> 27:57.675
Yes, she's from Yongpa High.

27:57.759 --> 27:59.260
Well, that school's not that far.

27:59.344 --> 28:01.388
Why are so many kids
transferring from there?

28:03.431 --> 28:04.391
I guess it tracks.

28:04.474 --> 28:07.936
I heard that school has so many bad kids.

28:08.019 --> 28:08.937
Gosh.

28:09.020 --> 28:10.313
Come on, sir.

28:10.397 --> 28:12.107
The kids must have their own reasons.

28:23.410 --> 28:26.121
- I want meat, not this.
- Just eat whatever I give you.

28:27.622 --> 28:28.456
Good boy.

28:28.540 --> 28:31.376
- You're eating so well, my baby.
- I'm hardly a baby.

28:31.459 --> 28:34.504
This reminds me of
how I fed you when you were little.

28:35.547 --> 28:37.674
How did my Leaky grow up so fast?

28:38.591 --> 28:39.801
Hey, Soo-ho,

28:39.884 --> 28:41.136
did you know?

28:41.219 --> 28:43.596
When Seo-jun was young,
his nickname was Leaky.

28:44.180 --> 28:45.014
"Leaky"?

28:45.098 --> 28:46.933
He wasn't potty trained until much later

28:47.016 --> 28:49.519
and would wet his bed at night,
so we called him Leaky.

28:49.602 --> 28:50.895
Why are you telling him that?

28:50.979 --> 28:51.813
Let's see.

28:51.896 --> 28:53.231
Was it until you were ten?

28:53.314 --> 28:54.315
Wait.

28:54.399 --> 28:56.776
You wet the bed once or twice
in the fifth grade.

28:56.860 --> 28:58.903
- Stop it, Mom.
- Gosh.

28:59.529 --> 29:01.698
What's there to be embarrassed about?

29:01.781 --> 29:04.325
You're best friends
who used to go to the sauna together.

29:05.076 --> 29:08.413
Anyway, how did you get
into an accident together?

29:08.496 --> 29:11.666
You guys haven't been hanging out lately,
as if you two had a fight.

29:12.667 --> 29:14.127
And Soo-ho,

29:14.210 --> 29:16.755
when you visited me
after I had my surgery,

29:16.838 --> 29:19.340
you insisted that I never tell
Seo-jun about your visit.

29:20.341 --> 29:22.260
I thought it was weird then too.

29:22.343 --> 29:23.428
It's not like that.

29:24.179 --> 29:25.597
How are you feeling these days?

29:25.680 --> 29:28.433
I feel great.
That's why I can come around like this.

29:28.516 --> 29:30.727
- You said you need to go to work.
- All right.

29:30.810 --> 29:32.228
Here, have this first.

29:33.646 --> 29:34.773
Come on. Good boy.

29:35.774 --> 29:36.858
Are you done?

29:37.442 --> 29:38.693
I'm going to take this out.

29:43.364 --> 29:46.201
Are you done too?
Do you want me to take it out for you?

29:46.284 --> 29:47.202
I'm all right.

29:48.411 --> 29:50.455
You should take care of Leaky over there.

29:50.538 --> 29:51.498
Hey!

29:56.419 --> 29:57.587
I've still got my feet.

30:08.932 --> 30:10.099
What's wrong?

30:10.183 --> 30:11.142
What?

30:12.560 --> 30:14.312
- You've got a problem?
- No.

30:14.896 --> 30:15.730
Okay, then.

30:17.106 --> 30:17.941
Hey, Soo-ho.

30:20.276 --> 30:21.110
Never mind.

30:23.029 --> 30:24.364
I can't wait. The bathroom…

30:25.031 --> 30:26.783
- The bathroom?
- I need to pee.

30:28.117 --> 30:29.577
Leaky, indeed.

30:30.662 --> 30:33.039
- Why are you telling me?
- Then who else do I tell?

30:33.122 --> 30:34.624
Call the nurse, Leaky.

30:34.707 --> 30:37.293
Hey, how can I ask the nurse
to take my pants off?

30:38.545 --> 30:39.546
Hello.

30:39.629 --> 30:41.339
I would like to switch rooms.

30:41.422 --> 30:43.842
- Is there an empty room available?
- Hey!

31:03.820 --> 31:04.654
- Babe,
- Yes?

31:04.737 --> 31:07.240
I heard that Soo-ho and Seo-jun
weren't hurt in an accident,

31:07.323 --> 31:09.033
but that it was because they brawled.

31:09.117 --> 31:10.285
- Really?
- Yes.

31:10.368 --> 31:12.036
It's weird they were
hospitalized together.

31:12.120 --> 31:13.371
That's what the rumors say.

31:13.454 --> 31:14.664
Who do you think won?

31:14.747 --> 31:16.165
It really was a car accident.

31:16.249 --> 31:18.918
My sister saw it
because it happened in front of her work.

31:20.128 --> 31:22.714
It wasn't that they fought
in front of your sister's work?

31:22.797 --> 31:24.299
She said it wasn't like that.

31:24.382 --> 31:26.467
Shouldn't we visit Soo-ho at the hospital?

31:26.551 --> 31:28.469
- Should we? We could all go tomorrow.
- Yes.

31:28.553 --> 31:31.848
- I'm going to be late for work. Bye!
- What? Okay, bye, Limju!

31:31.931 --> 31:33.141
Work hard, Lim Ju-kyung!

31:35.518 --> 31:37.228
- Lim Ju-kyung?
- Let's go!

31:42.692 --> 31:43.526
Hi.

31:44.485 --> 31:46.446
- Hi.
- Who's this beauty?

31:46.529 --> 31:48.656
Hi, but who are you?

31:48.740 --> 31:50.366
- Why are you replying?
- Come on.

31:50.450 --> 31:52.118
- Did you get introduced?
- Who is she?

31:52.201 --> 31:55.455
Hey, I'm embarrassed to ask you this…

31:55.538 --> 31:57.665
- Ask what?
- Your number.

31:59.459 --> 32:00.668
- Congratulations.
- It's 010-262--

32:00.752 --> 32:01.794
Do you know Han Seo-jun?

32:02.921 --> 32:05.798
Han Seo-jun?
He didn't come to school today.

32:05.882 --> 32:07.383
I've been waiting, but he didn't show.

32:07.467 --> 32:09.677
- But compared to that Seo-jun, I'm--
- Hey, Joo Hye-min!

32:11.095 --> 32:12.347
Why is that bitch here?

32:12.430 --> 32:14.474
- Hey, come on.
- Let's step back.

32:14.557 --> 32:16.809
- What the heck?
- Step back, man.

32:20.605 --> 32:23.149
Gosh, you transferred to Saebom High?

32:23.232 --> 32:25.568
You snitched on us bullying you,
then bailed.

32:25.652 --> 32:27.528
But you only made it this far?

32:27.612 --> 32:29.197
- Gosh.
- You stupid bitch.

32:29.280 --> 32:32.116
We got detention
because of your crazy ass.

32:32.784 --> 32:34.661
- Seriously!
- Hey, stop it.

32:35.787 --> 32:38.706
Joo Hye-min,
you want to get away from us, right?

32:40.208 --> 32:41.376
Answer me, bitch.

32:44.003 --> 32:46.130
Then, if you do as I say,

32:46.214 --> 32:47.632
I'll kindly let you go.

32:48.549 --> 32:49.717
Can you do that?

32:51.594 --> 32:52.553
Yes.

32:53.346 --> 32:55.723
There's someone called
Lim Ju-kyung at your school.

32:57.850 --> 33:00.603
- Ju-kyung?
- Yes, her name's the same as the Dumpling.

33:01.104 --> 33:04.273
Find out if she's really
dating Han Seo-jun.

33:06.693 --> 33:07.819
You're not answering?

33:08.569 --> 33:10.238
Okay. I will.

33:11.197 --> 33:13.533
Good. Update me regularly.

33:13.616 --> 33:14.784
You know what'll happen

33:15.284 --> 33:16.953
if you ignore my texts, right?

33:30.675 --> 33:31.509
Soo-ho!

33:34.053 --> 33:35.138
You're here.

33:37.473 --> 33:38.641
On a blind date, are we?

33:39.308 --> 33:42.520
Jeez. How did you get hurt?
You should have kept your eyes open.

33:42.603 --> 33:43.896
You didn't have to come.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.606
I was worried about you.

33:47.191 --> 33:50.236
It's an air-purifying plant.
It doesn't need to be watered often.

33:52.739 --> 33:54.574
I heard you said
you don't need a caregiver.

33:55.283 --> 33:56.951
Your dad asked me to get you things,

33:57.035 --> 33:58.578
so I brought items you might need.

34:00.705 --> 34:02.248
Face wash, toner…

34:04.834 --> 34:06.044
I brought your laptop too.

34:07.462 --> 34:08.379
Thanks.

34:08.463 --> 34:09.297
You're welcome.

34:11.132 --> 34:12.133
Thanks, Seo-jun.

34:13.009 --> 34:14.927
I heard you got hurt
trying to save Soo-ho.

34:15.011 --> 34:17.555
Why would you say thanks?
You're not even his girlfriend.

34:17.638 --> 34:19.557
If you don't want it, I take it back.

34:20.933 --> 34:23.144
Do you need to keep your cast on for long?

34:23.227 --> 34:24.771
You don't need surgery, do you?

34:27.440 --> 34:29.108
- Wait.
- It's all right.

34:33.154 --> 34:34.572
Don't they have a private room?

34:35.114 --> 34:38.159
- Want me to ask my dad for a transfer?
- No thanks. Here.

34:39.452 --> 34:40.369
Thanks.

34:40.453 --> 34:41.788
Don't you have academy today?

34:41.871 --> 34:42.997
I'm going to go later.

34:43.081 --> 34:44.999
Trying to send me away already?

34:45.083 --> 34:46.834
- Typical.
- Why did you come here alone?

34:48.044 --> 34:48.878
Where's Ju-kyung?

34:49.712 --> 34:52.006
- What?
- Aren't you two best friends?

34:52.090 --> 34:54.133
You're inseparable,
so it's odd to see you alone.

34:55.134 --> 34:56.385
She has work today.

34:57.303 --> 34:58.137
Why?

34:58.638 --> 35:00.139
Were you waiting for her?

35:00.223 --> 35:01.849
Why would you ask me that?

35:01.933 --> 35:03.351
He's the one you should ask.

35:07.063 --> 35:07.980
Why would I ask him?

35:08.481 --> 35:10.650
Aren't you the one dating Ju-kyung?

35:11.484 --> 35:13.569
- That's what everyone says.
- What?

35:19.909 --> 35:20.743
Jeez.

35:39.137 --> 35:41.097
- Enjoy.
- Thank you.

35:44.016 --> 35:45.059
What can I get for you?

35:46.602 --> 35:47.937
Goodness.

35:48.020 --> 35:49.897
Strawberries and grapefruit?

35:49.981 --> 35:51.315
You must like fresh flavors.

35:51.399 --> 35:53.401
Fresh flavors make you feel good, right?

35:56.904 --> 35:58.114
Just like you.

35:58.197 --> 35:59.240
What do you mean?

36:06.122 --> 36:08.416
You're fresh, just like a grapefruit.

36:08.499 --> 36:09.458
My grapefruit?

36:10.251 --> 36:11.085
Stop it.

36:11.752 --> 36:14.130
- What kind of pet name is that?
- What's the matter?

36:14.213 --> 36:16.174
Couples can have pet names, right?

36:16.257 --> 36:17.717
Am I right, my grapefruit?

36:18.759 --> 36:19.969
Stop it, my strawberry.

36:20.636 --> 36:21.929
See? It's weird.

36:24.849 --> 36:27.476
But Hee-kyung,
why didn't you go to work today?

36:28.978 --> 36:30.897
I yelled at my CEO.

36:30.980 --> 36:32.607
I took a day off
after realizing what I'd done.

36:33.649 --> 36:35.234
Should I quit before I get fired?

36:35.735 --> 36:37.111
Jun-woo.

36:37.820 --> 36:38.654
Ju-kyung…

36:39.614 --> 36:41.407
Ju-kyung's right there.

36:41.490 --> 36:43.784
Sorry? What's going on?

36:44.452 --> 36:45.411
Han Jun-woo!

36:54.462 --> 36:56.380
Ju-kyung finding out
bothers you that much?

36:58.049 --> 37:00.051
It doesn't feel right as her teacher.

37:00.551 --> 37:01.802
If Ju-kyung finds out,

37:02.470 --> 37:05.097
it will be difficult for her
to see me just as her teacher.

37:05.181 --> 37:06.599
And if the school finds out,

37:06.682 --> 37:08.601
if I even give her
a slightly higher score,

37:08.684 --> 37:11.437
people are bound to complain
about favoritism and partiality.

37:11.520 --> 37:12.438
I get it.

37:13.689 --> 37:14.857
We'll keep it a secret.

37:16.192 --> 37:17.026
Thank you.

37:21.948 --> 37:24.408
Anyway, why is she doing
part-time work here?

37:24.492 --> 37:26.077
Why is she making money in secret?

37:28.746 --> 37:30.248
She should be studying instead.

37:30.831 --> 37:35.169
But Ju-kyung seems to have
found her passion.

37:35.753 --> 37:38.714
She wrote down cosmetology
on her career interest survey.

37:38.798 --> 37:40.007
Didn't you know?

37:40.091 --> 37:41.050
Cosmetology?

37:45.263 --> 37:47.598
What have you been up to since earlier?

37:47.682 --> 37:49.892
Mom, try to punch me.

37:49.976 --> 37:51.102
Punch you? Why?

37:51.185 --> 37:54.647
I have now achieved dynamic visual acuity.

37:54.730 --> 37:57.275
Right, left.

37:59.193 --> 38:01.570
- Mom!
- Dynamic visual acuity, my foot.

38:01.654 --> 38:03.531
- Go to the hospital for me.
- The hospital?

38:03.614 --> 38:06.033
Dear Soo-ho got injured and hospitalized.

38:06.117 --> 38:09.245
With no mom to take care of him
and eating bland hospital meals…

38:09.328 --> 38:11.831
I made a beef stew for him,
so go give it to him.

38:11.914 --> 38:13.708
Jeez. How did he get hurt?

38:13.791 --> 38:14.959
But I'm busy right now.

38:16.544 --> 38:18.546
- Ask Dad.
- Your dad went to his class.

38:19.046 --> 38:20.339
Make the delivery, okay?

38:29.849 --> 38:31.058
- Hey, Mr. Lim.
- Yes?

38:31.142 --> 38:33.644
We're going for a cup of tea.
Would you like to join us?

38:34.312 --> 38:37.815
Thank you for inviting me,
but I have to go prepare dinner.

38:37.898 --> 38:41.694
- Goodness, you're so caring!
- What a nice guy!

38:41.777 --> 38:43.529
I know a place that has great coffee.

38:43.612 --> 38:45.489
- Really?
- If you come here

38:45.573 --> 38:47.658
and get either your eyelashes
or eyebrows done,

38:47.742 --> 38:49.160
coffee is free of charge.

38:49.243 --> 38:50.745
- I'll come.
- Of course, I'll come.

38:50.828 --> 38:51.871
See you next class.

38:51.954 --> 38:54.415
- I'll see you next time. Bye!
- Goodbye!

38:56.042 --> 38:58.085
- I'm sorry.
- Jeez.

39:07.762 --> 39:09.180
Columbus Park?

39:12.224 --> 39:13.476
Hey! Stop right there!

39:14.602 --> 39:16.228
Hey, stop!

39:20.107 --> 39:22.026
Hey, stop right there!
Where are you going?

39:22.109 --> 39:23.569
Hey! You, where are you going?

39:23.652 --> 39:25.654
Hey, you! Columbus!

39:30.117 --> 39:32.328
Sir, please follow the car in the front.

39:39.043 --> 39:40.503
Seo-jun must be there too.

39:41.712 --> 39:43.547
Why did I come without makeup yesterday?

39:44.924 --> 39:45.966
The mirror.

39:51.555 --> 39:52.556
Is that good enough?

39:54.016 --> 39:55.059
ROOM 505
LEE, HAN

39:56.310 --> 39:59.355
- Why don't you put it on yourself?
- Come on, do better.

40:06.612 --> 40:07.822
I'll come back later.

40:12.326 --> 40:13.202
Hi.

40:15.079 --> 40:16.122
Hey.

40:16.997 --> 40:18.707
You two look very close.

40:19.500 --> 40:20.501
Not at all.

40:21.168 --> 40:22.795
I was helping him get changed.

40:22.878 --> 40:23.921
Should I wait outside?

40:24.004 --> 40:25.965
Put it on quickly!

40:26.632 --> 40:27.842
I'll get him clothed soon.

40:40.521 --> 40:41.647
Going to the restroom?

40:43.107 --> 40:44.108
Do you need help?

40:44.191 --> 40:45.484
Help him with what?

40:46.318 --> 40:47.319
Right.

40:48.028 --> 40:50.030
It must be difficult by yourself.

40:50.114 --> 40:50.948
Man.

40:51.031 --> 40:52.867
Don't try to picture it or anything.

40:52.950 --> 40:54.201
I'm going for a walk.

41:06.213 --> 41:08.299
I brought these in case you get bored.

41:08.382 --> 41:10.801
It must have been heavy.
You shouldn't have.

41:12.761 --> 41:13.721
These look fun.

41:16.599 --> 41:17.725
GARDEN OF BLOOD

41:18.392 --> 41:19.560
I'll get it.

41:25.065 --> 41:26.817
- Hold on. I'll undo it.
- Wait.

41:26.901 --> 41:28.944
- Hold on.
- I'm sorry, wait a bit.

41:31.280 --> 41:32.573
- Hey.
- Gosh.

41:37.036 --> 41:38.913
Hey…

41:39.497 --> 41:41.582
Here. My mom wanted me to give you this.

41:43.501 --> 41:45.961
I'm leaving.
Get on with whatever you were doing.

41:46.045 --> 41:48.255
- It's not like that, Ju-young.
- My hair is--

41:49.798 --> 41:51.675
Just kiss!

41:52.259 --> 41:54.178
I'll kill you if you tell Mom, got it?

41:54.261 --> 41:56.639
Gosh, what do I do?

41:56.722 --> 41:57.556
Wait.

41:57.640 --> 41:59.767
Sorry. Can you scoot to the right?

42:00.518 --> 42:01.352
I'm sorry.

42:01.435 --> 42:03.771
- Not sure. What does Seo-jun like?
- Fried chicken.

42:07.316 --> 42:08.150
What do we do?

42:08.984 --> 42:09.985
What do we do?

42:11.695 --> 42:13.656
- Here.
- Hold on.

42:19.203 --> 42:21.497
- Seo-jun!
- We're here!

42:21.580 --> 42:22.998
- He's not here?
- He's not here.

42:23.082 --> 42:25.376
- Soo-ho!
- Soo-ho!

42:25.459 --> 42:26.460
- Soo-ho!
- Jeez!

42:26.544 --> 42:28.629
- My friend, Soo-ho!
- Goodness.

42:28.712 --> 42:29.964
- Soo-ho!
- Stop!

42:31.048 --> 42:32.174
Don't touch me.

42:32.258 --> 42:33.259
- Why?
- What's wrong?

42:33.342 --> 42:34.718
- It hurts.
- It hurts?

42:34.802 --> 42:35.844
- He's hurting.
- He is.

42:35.928 --> 42:36.929
It's heartbreaking.

42:37.012 --> 42:38.514
- Don't!
- Don't touch him!

42:38.597 --> 42:40.432
Goodness. Were you hurt badly?

42:44.228 --> 42:45.229
Am I dreaming?

42:45.312 --> 42:48.107
- Whatever.
- Hold on. What are you doing here?

42:48.190 --> 42:49.191
Are you sick?

42:49.275 --> 42:50.192
I'm fine.

42:50.276 --> 42:52.152
That's good. Hey, hold on.

42:52.236 --> 42:53.237
Don't you wonder

42:53.320 --> 42:54.697
what I'm doing here?

42:54.780 --> 42:56.740
Aren't you curious
if I'm all right or not?

42:56.824 --> 42:57.700
Not at all.

43:01.537 --> 43:03.497
What? Are you really not feeling well?

43:04.081 --> 43:06.125
I'm sick. I got this illness.

43:06.208 --> 43:09.128
- What illness?
- A horrible incurable disease.

43:09.211 --> 43:11.046
Symptoms? It's not just a couple.

43:11.130 --> 43:12.506
This brain, only thinking of Han Go-un.

43:12.590 --> 43:14.800
These eyes, only seeing Han Go-un.

43:14.883 --> 43:16.885
This heart, only beating for Han Go-un.

43:16.969 --> 43:21.015
These legs, running toward
Han Go-un on their own.

43:21.599 --> 43:23.267
- Really?
- Hey, bro!

43:23.350 --> 43:24.560
Too bad you're so sick.

43:24.643 --> 43:26.478
- "Bro"?
- What are you going to do?

43:26.562 --> 43:28.314
Looks like you'll be dying soon.

43:28.397 --> 43:29.440
At my hands.

43:33.444 --> 43:34.820
To Han Go-un,

43:34.903 --> 43:37.448
- Two.
- I won't make unwanted advances.

43:37.531 --> 43:39.700
How dare you hit on my sister?

43:39.783 --> 43:41.160
She said she's not interested!

43:41.243 --> 43:43.704
I'm going to make her interested!

43:43.787 --> 43:45.706
- One.
- To Han Go-un,

43:45.789 --> 43:47.041
Two.

43:47.833 --> 43:50.377
- I like you.
- You little…

43:51.462 --> 43:53.797
I like Han Go-un.

43:53.881 --> 43:55.758
Hey, I'll see you again.

43:56.467 --> 43:57.676
You, stop right there!

43:58.927 --> 44:00.095
That nutcase.

44:02.306 --> 44:05.142
Here, your underwear.

44:05.934 --> 44:06.769
By the way,

44:07.269 --> 44:08.228
does Ju-kyung know?

44:08.312 --> 44:10.648
- That her brother likes you?
- What?

44:10.731 --> 44:12.650
That's Ju-kyung's little brother?

44:17.571 --> 44:18.489
It tastes good.

44:20.991 --> 44:22.910
It tastes good. Hey, try this.

44:23.952 --> 44:25.120
- It's good.
- It is, right?

44:25.204 --> 44:26.872
- Han Seo-jun!
- Hey, Seo-jun!

44:26.955 --> 44:29.208
- Seo-jun, you're alive!
- Jeez, look at this.

44:29.291 --> 44:31.460
- Hey, come here.
- What's this

44:32.336 --> 44:34.672
Seo-jun, are you all right?

44:35.172 --> 44:36.548
- It hurts.
- It does?

44:36.632 --> 44:38.008
Seo-jun!

44:38.092 --> 44:39.885
You look good even in a hospital gown.

44:39.968 --> 44:42.304
The glorious wound and the cast.

44:42.388 --> 44:43.639
- You still look nice.
- You do.

44:43.722 --> 44:45.557
Do you know how worried I was?

44:45.641 --> 44:48.686
- I had lost my appetite, seriously.
- He really did worry.

44:48.769 --> 44:52.022
Hey! It's all those snacks
that chase away your appetite.

44:55.275 --> 44:57.319
Old farts over there,
can you keep it down?

44:57.403 --> 44:58.737
Can't you see the quiet sign?

44:58.821 --> 45:00.322
This isn't your private room.

45:00.406 --> 45:02.032
I'm thirsty. Do you have a drink?

45:03.200 --> 45:04.410
Aloe vera juice.

45:10.207 --> 45:11.041
I'm sorry.

45:11.667 --> 45:12.751
I'll fix it right away.

45:14.169 --> 45:15.003
What are these?

45:16.046 --> 45:19.383
- Hey, give those back!
- Look at his underwear!

45:19.466 --> 45:20.759
They're playing around.

45:21.343 --> 45:22.302
- Very nice!
- Very nice!

45:22.386 --> 45:23.220
Give them back!

45:23.303 --> 45:25.597
- Move over. Give them back!
- Just for a minute.

45:26.598 --> 45:29.560
- Our Soo-ho needs his rest.
- Come on, give them back!

45:29.643 --> 45:32.062
Look at that cold sweat. Goodness!

45:32.146 --> 45:33.522
What do we do?

45:33.605 --> 45:34.815
What do we do?

45:34.898 --> 45:37.192
- My hands are fine.
- They are?

45:37.276 --> 45:39.736
Then, I'll wipe down your feet
which are not fine.

45:39.820 --> 45:41.155
Wait!

45:41.780 --> 45:42.656
Soo-ho, your foot!

45:49.830 --> 45:51.623
Your foot is very small and cute.

45:51.707 --> 45:53.667
That's a surprise. You like pink?

45:54.751 --> 45:56.295
How dare you touch my foot?

45:57.129 --> 45:58.130
Hey.

45:58.714 --> 46:01.341
I just wanted to wipe your foot…

46:01.425 --> 46:02.551
He has very weird taste.

46:03.051 --> 46:04.303
I can't believe it.

46:04.386 --> 46:05.929
That was so mean.

46:06.513 --> 46:07.347
Jeez.

46:10.309 --> 46:11.768
How could you?

46:13.353 --> 46:15.939
- We decided on fried chicken.
- By the way, where's the TV?

46:16.023 --> 46:17.357
- Hey.
- Where are we ordering from?

46:17.441 --> 46:19.401
- Let's get pizza too.
- Order what Seo-jun likes!

46:19.485 --> 46:21.111
How about that place from the last time?

46:21.195 --> 46:23.989
- Sauce?
- Soy sauce? Or garlic?

46:24.072 --> 46:25.365
- Hey!
- Yes?

46:25.449 --> 46:26.742
You should all leave now.

46:27.451 --> 46:28.785
But why?

46:28.869 --> 46:31.622
- I'm going to stay the night.
- Hey! We'll take care of you all night.

46:31.705 --> 46:33.165
We're friends, you know?

46:33.248 --> 46:34.750
- Loyalty!
- Loyalty!

46:34.833 --> 46:36.251
Where do you expect to sleep, big guy?

46:36.335 --> 46:37.503
- Leave!
- Yes, please do.

46:37.586 --> 46:38.712
You guys are too loud.

46:38.795 --> 46:40.130
You should go too, please.

46:40.214 --> 46:41.048
Soo-ho!

46:41.131 --> 46:42.799
You're really hurting my feelings!

46:42.883 --> 46:44.218
I should leave now.

46:44.301 --> 46:45.511
- What?
- Hey, let's go.

46:46.345 --> 46:48.180
- Why?
- Let's go.

46:48.263 --> 46:50.015
That's it. You guys leave too.

46:50.098 --> 46:51.099
Hey,

46:51.183 --> 46:53.727
why are you dying to make us leave?

46:53.810 --> 46:54.937
Come on!

46:55.604 --> 46:57.856
I just want to be alone with Soo-ho.

46:57.940 --> 46:59.233
- Alone?
- Just the two of you?

47:00.234 --> 47:01.693
I approve of this bromance.

47:01.777 --> 47:02.778
- Me too.
- Me too.

47:02.861 --> 47:05.447
- When did you make up?
- Did you guys make up?

47:06.240 --> 47:07.407
Right.

47:07.491 --> 47:10.410
I hear they're shooting
that show with Yeo Ha-jin in the lobby.

47:10.494 --> 47:13.789
- What, Yeo Ha-jin?
- Everyone's first crush, Yeo Ha-jin?

47:16.333 --> 47:17.209
I'm sorry, Su-ah!

47:17.918 --> 47:19.962
Just go! Leave!

47:25.092 --> 47:26.885
I'm sorry, Seo-jun! Let's go.

47:54.997 --> 47:55.956
You scared me.

47:56.039 --> 47:57.374
Why are you out here?

47:57.457 --> 47:59.376
I took the trouble to chase them away.

47:59.459 --> 48:00.294
Well,

48:00.377 --> 48:01.503
it's getting late.

48:01.587 --> 48:03.964
Why do you go through the hassle
to keep it a secret?

48:04.464 --> 48:06.425
Just tell them and be done with it.

48:06.508 --> 48:08.594
I can't do it yet.

48:08.677 --> 48:10.470
Why? Because of Su-jin?

48:10.554 --> 48:11.471
Hey, I told you…

48:12.306 --> 48:13.849
that was just an example.

48:13.932 --> 48:15.934
Gosh, you're so funny.

48:16.018 --> 48:18.061
Hey, what do you have on your hair?

48:19.396 --> 48:20.480
I'm sorry.

48:21.148 --> 48:23.525
Darn it. I'll need to cut this out.

48:24.318 --> 48:26.153
What did you do on the bed
to take a button off?

48:27.988 --> 48:30.574
I guess your loneliness
makes you imaginative.

48:30.657 --> 48:31.992
The boys were just messing with me!

48:32.701 --> 48:33.827
Then I'll write one too.

48:34.828 --> 48:35.746
Give me your arm.

48:36.830 --> 48:38.999
Hey, don't write anything weird.

48:43.086 --> 48:44.004
Done.

48:45.422 --> 48:46.423
I'm leaving.

48:48.675 --> 48:51.637
Rise up, spirit of the tiger. Roar!

48:51.720 --> 48:53.388
Right. Seo-jun!

48:54.806 --> 48:55.766
Roar!

48:59.561 --> 49:01.396
It never gets old to her, does it?

49:04.650 --> 49:06.610
BEAUTY SALON

49:06.693 --> 49:09.905
You should have gotten a touch-up sooner.
Why did you come just now?

49:09.988 --> 49:11.573
Still, it'll last longer now.

49:12.199 --> 49:13.575
- Thank you.
- Let me see.

49:16.995 --> 49:18.705
- Are you done?
- Yes, it came out well.

49:18.789 --> 49:20.582
Mom!

49:21.166 --> 49:24.378
- Are you going to get something?
- No, I'm here to check on what's mine.

49:24.461 --> 49:26.380
What's yours? What do you mean?

49:26.963 --> 49:29.800
I am going to head out.

49:30.759 --> 49:32.719
Ms. Hong, your shop is still open, right?

49:32.803 --> 49:34.262
- Hello.
- Goodness.

49:35.347 --> 49:38.558
I didn't know you had
such a young and handsome customer.

49:39.768 --> 49:41.228
Well, then, I'll get going…

49:42.187 --> 49:43.855
He's Ju-kyung's teacher.

49:44.439 --> 49:47.651
- Hello.
- Gosh, I could tell from your features

49:47.734 --> 49:49.778
that you were a teacher.

49:50.445 --> 49:53.407
- Are you married?
- No, not yet.

49:53.490 --> 49:55.367
Goodness, what a coincidence.

49:56.034 --> 49:57.703
My daughter isn't married either.

49:57.786 --> 49:59.996
I think you'd hit it off with her.

50:00.080 --> 50:01.832
Don't you want a blind date?

50:01.915 --> 50:04.042
Well, thank you for the offer,

50:04.126 --> 50:05.419
but no, thank you.

50:05.502 --> 50:06.920
- I'll get going, then.
- Goodbye.

50:07.504 --> 50:08.839
But why not?

50:08.922 --> 50:09.965
If things work out,

50:10.048 --> 50:13.385
you'd have my pork trotters for free
for the rest of your life.

50:13.468 --> 50:16.388
Jeez, who'd marry for free pork trotters?

50:16.471 --> 50:18.306
You marry for a like-minded soul.

50:18.390 --> 50:20.600
- Goodbye, Mr. Han.
- Good night.

50:22.269 --> 50:25.063
Why don't you set Hee-kyung up
for a blind date?

50:25.147 --> 50:26.565
Do you know any nice guys?

50:27.232 --> 50:28.400
Should I?

50:28.483 --> 50:30.360
Hee-kyung, what type of men are you into?

50:31.027 --> 50:32.696
- Just say the word.
- Well.

50:33.363 --> 50:34.948
The type of men I'm into?

50:35.907 --> 50:38.452
As for age,
someone who was born in early 1990.

50:38.994 --> 50:40.454
Someone without thick eyebrows.

50:40.537 --> 50:43.540
Someone who looks cute with bangs
but sexy with them pushed back.

50:43.623 --> 50:45.292
Someone who seems modest and quiet,

50:45.375 --> 50:47.711
but acts like a kitten
when he's making a fuss.

50:47.794 --> 50:48.754
Someone who makes me…

50:48.837 --> 50:49.880
flustered all the time.

50:49.963 --> 50:51.047
Someone like that.

50:53.842 --> 50:56.219
Just say you don't want to date.
Where's a guy like that?

50:56.303 --> 50:57.971
- There is.
- She's insane.

50:58.054 --> 51:00.056
- Mom, I'm going to hit the store. Bye!
- Okay.

51:00.640 --> 51:01.516
That brat.

51:01.600 --> 51:02.726
Come back home soon!

51:04.644 --> 51:05.479
- Jun-woo.
- Gosh.

51:06.104 --> 51:07.105
Where are you going?

51:10.066 --> 51:12.110
Why do you keep running away?
It flusters me.

51:13.820 --> 51:16.531
This is your neighborhood.
What if Ju-kyung sees us?

51:16.615 --> 51:18.033
She won't pass this alley.

51:19.075 --> 51:19.910
Is that so?

51:22.788 --> 51:24.873
- Do you like pork trotters?
- Excuse me?

51:24.956 --> 51:27.042
Who told you to smile like that
to strangers?

51:27.125 --> 51:28.960
- What did I do?
- It's your pretty smile

51:29.044 --> 51:31.588
that has everyone considering you
a potential groom.

51:32.547 --> 51:34.132
To you, maybe.

51:35.008 --> 51:36.176
Your eyebrows are pretty.

51:36.843 --> 51:38.094
You're prettier, Hee-kyung.

51:39.638 --> 51:40.472
Lower your face.

51:47.854 --> 51:48.688
Hee-kyung?

51:51.691 --> 51:54.319
- Who were you kissing? Your boyfriend?
- Leave!

51:54.402 --> 51:56.196
- Leave!
- Let go of me. Who is it?

51:57.197 --> 51:59.199
- Let go.
- I said, leave!

51:59.282 --> 52:01.034
Just let go! Seriously…

52:02.536 --> 52:04.120
Who's that? Is it someone I know?

52:04.204 --> 52:05.956
I said, no.

52:06.039 --> 52:08.333
Goodness. What's with my sisters today?

52:08.416 --> 52:10.377
Why are you getting caught
being all lovey-dovey?

52:11.169 --> 52:12.420
Let's just go home.

52:13.255 --> 52:14.172
Where have you been?

52:23.348 --> 52:26.017
SAEBOM CARD
YONGPA TAXI 154,000 WON

52:26.101 --> 52:29.646
One, ten, hundred, thousand,
ten thousand, hundred thousand…

52:29.729 --> 52:31.064
Honey!

52:31.147 --> 52:33.358
I found him!

52:33.441 --> 52:35.110
- Found who?
- Columbus Park!

52:35.193 --> 52:38.071
I was heading out of my class,
and our eyes locked.

52:38.154 --> 52:39.447
To get him, I…

52:39.531 --> 52:41.741
- Did you get in a cab?
- I did!

52:41.825 --> 52:43.451
So my cab chased after his.

52:43.535 --> 52:45.203
Just like a car chase in the movies.

52:47.497 --> 52:48.748
"Halt, Columbus Park!"

52:48.832 --> 52:50.208
"Sir, go a little faster."

52:50.292 --> 52:51.668
So? Did you catch him?

52:51.751 --> 52:53.253
I lost him!

52:53.753 --> 52:54.629
But honey,

52:54.713 --> 52:57.507
at least I confirmed that he's in Seoul.

52:57.591 --> 53:00.051
Confirmed, my foot!
You just lost 150,000 won!

53:00.135 --> 53:01.970
- Honey, wait…
- I just can't!

53:02.053 --> 53:04.431
- Honey, think it through.
- Darn it!

53:04.514 --> 53:06.516
At least we know he's in Seoul!

53:06.600 --> 53:09.185
Who cares? You just burned 150,000 won!

53:13.398 --> 53:14.900
You should come clean to me.

53:15.442 --> 53:17.652
- Are you studying cosmetology?
- How did you know?

53:17.736 --> 53:18.904
"How did you know?"

53:18.987 --> 53:21.740
You're not trying something out
because you don't want to study, are you?

53:21.823 --> 53:24.492
It's not like that.
I'm seriously considering it.

53:25.327 --> 53:26.953
I really want to do this.

53:27.037 --> 53:30.165
But I haven't started properly yet.
I haven't registered at a beauty school.

53:30.248 --> 53:32.375
Are you working part-time
to earn your tuition?

53:32.459 --> 53:34.085
How did you know about that?

53:35.712 --> 53:36.546
It's obvious…

53:37.339 --> 53:39.174
seeing how you get home so late lately.

53:40.008 --> 53:41.927
Gosh, you're good.

53:42.010 --> 53:43.553
You have amazing intuition.

53:44.220 --> 53:46.222
But don't tell Mom for a while.

53:46.806 --> 53:50.393
I'll get really good grades on my exams
and then ask for her permission.

53:51.269 --> 53:52.228
I'll be off then.

53:55.315 --> 53:56.232
Ju-kyung,

53:56.316 --> 53:58.860
if the part-time job is tough,
I can pay for the tuition.

53:58.944 --> 54:01.196
No, I want to try it on my own.

54:01.279 --> 54:03.406
Gosh, you're all grown up now.

54:03.490 --> 54:04.574
- Bye!
- Bye.

54:06.117 --> 54:09.079
Ju-kyung, let me know
if things get too tough, okay?

54:09.746 --> 54:12.207
Will do. Thanks, sis! I love you!

54:18.922 --> 54:19.756
What?

54:20.548 --> 54:21.758
Mr. Han's girlfriend

54:22.801 --> 54:24.052
is Ju-kyung's older sister?

54:37.190 --> 54:38.441
Good morning, sir!

54:38.942 --> 54:39.776
Ju-kyung,

54:40.860 --> 54:41.861
have this.

54:41.945 --> 54:43.780
I love anything strawberry.

54:43.863 --> 54:44.906
Thank you.

54:44.990 --> 54:47.200
- Have a great day, Ju-kyung!
- Thank you, sir.

54:55.834 --> 54:56.668
Hello.

54:57.168 --> 54:58.586
You make it too obvious.

54:59.671 --> 55:00.755
What do you mean?

55:01.548 --> 55:03.299
You're being too nice to her

55:03.383 --> 55:05.468
for being the sister of your girlfriend!

55:07.595 --> 55:08.430
Well,

55:09.514 --> 55:10.974
I still don't get what you mean…

55:14.185 --> 55:15.020
I don't know.

55:16.104 --> 55:18.189
I'm not the type to make it obvious.

55:22.485 --> 55:26.406
When two wrappers A and B
are placed on the coordinate plane,

55:27.073 --> 55:30.326
let's say the upper boundary
of the gilt pattern

55:32.078 --> 55:32.996
is y equals

55:33.830 --> 55:35.373
f of x.

55:36.291 --> 55:37.167
The lower boundary…

55:37.250 --> 55:39.127
He's probably doing well, right?

55:40.879 --> 55:42.338
I wonder what he's up to.

55:50.055 --> 55:53.975
When specified as such,
the area between these two curves

55:55.769 --> 55:57.687
will be the same.

56:00.982 --> 56:01.816
Jeez.

56:02.442 --> 56:03.276
Give it to me.

56:06.446 --> 56:07.489
I want the meat.

56:08.573 --> 56:09.657
Yours look tastier.

56:14.829 --> 56:16.247
Stop spilling, Leaky.

56:25.090 --> 56:25.924
There we go.

56:27.634 --> 56:28.885
I'll push you with my legs.

56:28.968 --> 56:30.595
- Hey!
- Okay.

56:31.096 --> 56:32.764
Pull it back a little.

56:33.598 --> 56:34.557
Turn right.

56:35.225 --> 56:36.142
Come on.

56:38.311 --> 56:39.270
Here.

56:39.354 --> 56:40.980
You carry this around?

56:41.689 --> 56:42.649
I'm impressed.

56:42.732 --> 56:44.692
For my followers who support me,

56:44.776 --> 56:47.862
even a single selfie needs my best care.

56:49.697 --> 56:51.616
- It looks good.
- She's glowing.

56:51.699 --> 56:53.284
- It's really different.
- It works.

56:55.411 --> 56:57.455
- It's the best photo ever!
- It looks good.

56:57.539 --> 57:00.250
I'm submitting this
to the Newstagram Goddess Competition.

57:01.668 --> 57:03.586
- Do you want to enter too?
- No, I'm good.

57:03.670 --> 57:05.046
Ju-kyung, you should take one.

57:05.130 --> 57:07.048
- I feel like you'll do well.
- Give it a go.

57:07.132 --> 57:09.551
I'll pour my soul into your picture.

57:10.135 --> 57:10.969
Okay.

57:11.719 --> 57:13.888
All right, Ju-kyung, one, two, three!

57:15.014 --> 57:16.015
Hold up the reflector.

57:17.642 --> 57:18.476
Stay still.

57:19.602 --> 57:20.645
You look so pretty.

57:21.729 --> 57:23.314
Give me goddess vibes, okay?

57:23.398 --> 57:24.566
Beautiful.

57:28.111 --> 57:30.488
What? Why are you taking
pictures of Ju-kyung?

57:35.535 --> 57:36.494
It's nothing.

57:36.578 --> 57:38.121
My fingers slipped.

57:38.204 --> 57:39.581
- Get the sunlight.
- Stay still.

57:42.292 --> 57:44.794
You look so pretty.

57:45.503 --> 57:47.464
Look over there, into the distance.

57:50.425 --> 57:51.426
Press it down firmly.

57:54.429 --> 57:56.139
I'll switch it out right away.

58:00.477 --> 58:01.311
Soo-ho.

58:05.982 --> 58:07.192
I told you not to come.

58:08.276 --> 58:10.653
Let's talk, please?

58:13.948 --> 58:15.283
I feel better now.

58:15.825 --> 58:16.659
Hey.

58:17.702 --> 58:19.120
- What?
- You came again?

58:19.704 --> 58:21.372
You're literally coming here every day.

58:21.956 --> 58:24.667
I can't call him and I'm worried.
I have to come to see him.

58:24.751 --> 58:26.503
That's a touching story.

58:26.586 --> 58:28.713
Hey, you have one less cast!

58:28.796 --> 58:32.008
Yes, they took another x-ray
and it was all good to go.

58:32.091 --> 58:33.468
That's great news.

58:33.551 --> 58:35.428
Soo-ho should get better soon too.

58:35.929 --> 58:36.763
Hey,

58:37.430 --> 58:40.975
- did you know Soo-ho had a cousin?
- What?

58:43.019 --> 58:46.022
Sure. I knew that.

58:58.076 --> 58:59.410
Why did you do that?

58:59.494 --> 59:00.745
Se-yeon was my friend.

59:02.121 --> 59:03.790
Why in the world did you do that?

59:08.461 --> 59:10.088
I had no idea about Se-yeon's story.

59:12.257 --> 59:14.342
I'd entrusted Director Oh with everything.

59:15.218 --> 59:17.845
I had no idea that was how
he would deal with things.

59:17.929 --> 59:19.806
If I had, I wouldn't have done that.

59:20.306 --> 59:22.308
As you said, Se-yeon was your friend.

59:22.976 --> 59:24.811
How could I ever do such a thing to him?

59:24.894 --> 59:26.563
So everything's on Director Oh?

59:28.398 --> 59:30.858
They said that was to cover up your story.

59:32.485 --> 59:33.361
Also,

59:34.362 --> 59:36.614
are you simply going to plead ignorance?

59:39.117 --> 59:41.786
Do you really think
you're blameless in all this?

59:44.163 --> 59:45.206
Did you know…

59:47.417 --> 59:49.794
I thought Se-yeon made such a choice…

59:51.879 --> 59:54.674
because I didn't answer his last call.

59:57.093 --> 59:59.262
Do you know how much I suffered?

01:00:01.180 --> 01:00:02.181
It turned out…

01:00:03.224 --> 01:00:05.768
you were at the start of all this.

01:00:06.936 --> 01:00:08.938
Did a scandal scare you that much?

01:00:09.480 --> 01:00:10.857
That was nothing!

01:00:12.609 --> 01:00:13.526
That…

01:00:15.445 --> 01:00:17.697
I didn't want you to be
disappointed in me.

01:00:18.656 --> 01:00:20.325
Our relationship was shaky as it is.

01:00:20.408 --> 01:00:21.618
I thought such an article…

01:00:22.118 --> 01:00:23.703
would make you grow more distant.

01:00:24.621 --> 01:00:25.955
So I tried to cover it up.

01:00:28.374 --> 01:00:30.960
How could I be disappointed
when I had no expectations?

01:00:33.004 --> 01:00:34.088
Long ago,

01:00:36.841 --> 01:00:38.134
I'd already seen everything.

01:00:40.511 --> 01:00:43.097
What you did on the day Mom died.

01:00:56.110 --> 01:00:57.028
What?

01:00:59.864 --> 01:01:00.782
You saw?

01:01:02.450 --> 01:01:04.535
- Soo-ho, back then…
- Please leave.

01:01:05.912 --> 01:01:06.746
Soo-ho.

01:01:07.372 --> 01:01:08.289
Soo-ho!

01:01:08.373 --> 01:01:09.457
I said, leave!

01:01:13.002 --> 01:01:14.045
Soo-ho.

01:01:14.712 --> 01:01:15.713
Soo-ho!

01:01:15.797 --> 01:01:16.798
- Soo-ho!
- Soo-ho!

01:01:16.881 --> 01:01:18.800
Soo-ho, stay with me! Soo-ho!

01:01:18.883 --> 01:01:20.760
Soo-ho, what's wrong? Over here!

01:01:20.843 --> 01:01:22.679
- Soo-ho!
- Sir?

01:01:22.762 --> 01:01:24.472
- What's wrong? Wake up!
- Are you okay?

01:01:24.555 --> 01:01:27.225
Soo-ho, wake up!

01:01:28.017 --> 01:01:30.061
He seems to have suffered a panic attack.

01:01:30.561 --> 01:01:34.232
ECG and other tests didn't show anomalies,
so it's likely a psychological issue.

01:01:34.315 --> 01:01:35.983
If he suffers such episodes often,

01:01:36.067 --> 01:01:38.569
I recommend bringing him
into the psychology department

01:01:38.653 --> 01:01:40.113
and getting him some counseling.

01:02:02.218 --> 01:02:03.803
I knew he kept things to himself,

01:02:04.595 --> 01:02:07.181
but I didn't know it was to the extent
that he'd get sick.

01:02:09.892 --> 01:02:11.644
I'm telling you this
because he won't himself.

01:02:14.147 --> 01:02:14.981
Leo…

01:02:16.149 --> 01:02:17.024
is Lee Soo-ho.

01:02:20.945 --> 01:02:21.821
What?

01:02:22.488 --> 01:02:24.282
Can't you tell just by seeing his home?

01:02:25.199 --> 01:02:26.200
Are you even his dad?

01:02:28.536 --> 01:02:30.079
When he wrote songs with Se-yeon,

01:02:31.038 --> 01:02:32.999
you have no idea how happy he was, do you?

01:04:13.266 --> 01:04:17.061
Actually, I like Soo-ho.

01:04:17.728 --> 01:04:19.063
But it hurts a little.

01:05:13.242 --> 01:05:14.076
Leo

01:05:14.577 --> 01:05:15.411
is Lee Soo-ho.

01:05:17.997 --> 01:05:19.790
When he wrote songs with Se-yeon,

01:05:19.874 --> 01:05:21.959
you have no idea how happy he was, do you?

01:05:42.021 --> 01:05:44.815
What you did on the day Mom died.

01:05:56.911 --> 01:05:59.121
I thought Se-yeon made such a choice…

01:06:00.539 --> 01:06:03.626
because I didn't answer his last call.

01:06:04.210 --> 01:06:06.671
Do you know how much I suffered?

01:06:18.224 --> 01:06:20.059
So how long will you take it out on me?

01:06:20.893 --> 01:06:21.852
Until you die…

01:06:23.396 --> 01:06:24.981
and meet Se-yeon again.

01:06:28.442 --> 01:06:29.402
Never forget.

01:06:30.903 --> 01:06:32.446
You killed Se-yeon,

01:06:33.656 --> 01:06:35.116
and you don't deserve to smile.

01:06:48.254 --> 01:06:49.714
He's sleeping as if he's dead.

01:06:58.180 --> 01:06:59.640
Is he even breathing?

01:07:12.486 --> 01:07:14.280
I saw it all. Why put up a show?

01:07:20.494 --> 01:07:21.328
What?

01:07:21.912 --> 01:07:23.497
I want to get some fresh air,

01:07:24.457 --> 01:07:25.666
but there's no wheelchair.

01:07:25.750 --> 01:07:27.835
Just sleep. It's the middle of the night.

01:07:31.047 --> 01:07:31.881
Seriously?

01:07:34.675 --> 01:07:36.010
Hold on tight.

01:07:36.802 --> 01:07:37.636
You're heavy.

01:07:40.306 --> 01:07:41.140
Hey.

01:07:41.223 --> 01:07:43.851
How do you weigh a ton
with such a tiny head?

01:07:43.934 --> 01:07:45.561
- Why do you talk so much?
- Goodness.

01:07:46.312 --> 01:07:47.188
Soo-ho,

01:07:47.271 --> 01:07:49.190
we'll settle all this when your legs heal.

01:07:51.192 --> 01:07:52.193
Jeez.

01:07:52.276 --> 01:07:54.278
Use your strength, Leaky.

01:07:54.361 --> 01:07:55.738
I am using my strength.

01:07:58.365 --> 01:07:59.658
What are you doing?

01:07:59.742 --> 01:08:01.035
We didn't have a wheelchair.

01:08:01.535 --> 01:08:03.120
You could've called for one.

01:08:03.204 --> 01:08:04.705
Wait here, please.

01:08:07.041 --> 01:08:09.126
Hey, you should have called them!

01:08:09.210 --> 01:08:11.420
Why didn't you go get it
with your working legs?

01:08:11.504 --> 01:08:13.756
- I didn't think of that!
- Me neither!

01:08:13.839 --> 01:08:15.758
You're the top student.
Don't you use your brain?

01:08:15.841 --> 01:08:16.842
What place are you in?

01:08:33.317 --> 01:08:34.193
Why…

01:08:35.611 --> 01:08:36.946
didn't you tell me back then?

01:08:39.115 --> 01:08:40.866
That you didn't meet Se-yeon that day?

01:08:44.620 --> 01:08:45.746
All this time,

01:08:46.705 --> 01:08:49.667
I thought Se-yeon did it because
you didn't believe him. That's why…

01:08:52.294 --> 01:08:53.838
You should have told me.

01:08:53.921 --> 01:08:55.047
So what if I'd told you?

01:08:57.007 --> 01:08:58.843
It's not like he would have
come back to life.

01:09:03.806 --> 01:09:05.975
I thought he had died because of me.

01:09:10.563 --> 01:09:12.273
"If only I answered his call,

01:09:16.110 --> 01:09:17.653
maybe I could have prevented it."

01:09:22.324 --> 01:09:23.159
Is that…

01:09:24.827 --> 01:09:27.079
what you've been thinking all this time?

01:09:31.292 --> 01:09:32.418
You're so thick.

01:09:44.555 --> 01:09:47.725
Ju-young, come here and have some fruit.

01:09:49.059 --> 01:09:52.605
Where's Ju-kyung when it's the weekend?
Didn't she leave early in the morning?

01:09:52.688 --> 01:09:53.522
Job.

01:09:54.315 --> 01:09:55.149
What?

01:09:56.775 --> 01:09:58.319
It's not my job to know.

01:09:59.111 --> 01:10:01.405
You should care about your sister.

01:10:01.488 --> 01:10:04.074
Lee Ju-hun, the CEO of Move Entertainment,

01:10:04.158 --> 01:10:05.951
- What is he saying?
- revealed that Black Soul's

01:10:06.035 --> 01:10:07.453
title track was plagiarized.

01:10:07.536 --> 01:10:10.289
He announced his retirement
and resignation from the company.

01:10:10.372 --> 01:10:12.750
- His retirement?
- Lee says that the title track

01:10:12.833 --> 01:10:14.168
of the new group, Black Soul,

01:10:14.251 --> 01:10:16.420
- Hello? Ma'am?
- was the late Jeong Se-yeon's…

01:10:16.503 --> 01:10:17.922
- Did you see the news?
- Mom!

01:10:18.005 --> 01:10:19.340
Lee Ju-hun's going to retire.

01:10:19.423 --> 01:10:20.674
But Mr. Lee!

01:10:21.217 --> 01:10:23.469
Why? My goodness!

01:10:23.552 --> 01:10:25.971
No!

01:10:27.598 --> 01:10:30.059
My dear Mr. Lee!

01:10:30.142 --> 01:10:34.230
The two points on this graph
are defined as A and B, respectively.

01:10:34.313 --> 01:10:37.399
Then the function value of A
becomes f of A,

01:10:37.483 --> 01:10:39.318
and that of B becomes f of B.

01:10:39.401 --> 01:10:42.196
Now, the limit.
Slicing it up into the tiniest possible…

01:10:42.279 --> 01:10:44.573
Kangsu, it's huge. Have you seen the news?

01:10:44.657 --> 01:10:45.574
Between A and B…

01:10:45.658 --> 01:10:50.037
LEE JU-HUN ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT
AND APOLOGIZES FOR JEONG SE-YEON'S DEATH

01:10:50.120 --> 01:10:53.082
…B gradually moves lower, and…

01:10:56.001 --> 01:10:56.835
Su-jin!

01:11:06.470 --> 01:11:08.597
LEE JU-HUN REVEALS TRUTH
ABOUT JEONG SE-YEON'S DEATH

01:11:23.737 --> 01:11:24.613
Soo-ho.

01:11:35.291 --> 01:11:36.417
It's Ju-kyung, again.

01:11:37.876 --> 01:11:38.711
Yes.

01:11:46.593 --> 01:11:47.636
It's me again.

01:11:49.179 --> 01:11:50.389
I missed you.

01:11:54.810 --> 01:11:55.894
And you're here.

01:11:58.814 --> 01:12:00.357
I came to give you a hug.

01:13:59.935 --> 01:14:02.438
I poured out everything
I'd pressed down deep inside,

01:14:02.521 --> 01:14:03.939
but it still feels heavy.

01:14:04.731 --> 01:14:07.067
If you can't sleep at night,
talk to these guys.

01:14:07.151 --> 01:14:10.112
Tell them all your sadness and worries.

01:14:10.737 --> 01:14:12.197
It's Ju-kyung.

01:14:12.281 --> 01:14:13.782
My girlfriend.

01:14:13.866 --> 01:14:17.828
Goddess, how does it feel to turn
the world of social media upside down?

01:14:17.911 --> 01:14:19.204
Lim Ju-kyung!

01:14:19.705 --> 01:14:20.956
She transferred from Yongpa High School.

01:14:21.039 --> 01:14:24.626
There was also a girl named
Lim Ju-kyung at my old school.

01:14:24.710 --> 01:14:25.711
Are you

01:14:25.794 --> 01:14:27.796
the same Kang Su-jin I used to know?

01:14:28.380 --> 01:14:32.968
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
